    <string name="welcome">Watch and run your Cybercore hosts from your phone: services, stacks, diagnostics and alerts, over your tailnet.</string>
    <string name="add_host_steps" tools:ignore="TypographyDashes">On the host:\n1. Install nightwatchd (packaging/install.sh).\n2. nightwatchd token add \"My phone\" --operate --qr\n3. Scan the QR code, or enter the tailnet URL and token here.\n\nA token made without --operate can only look.</string>
