    <string name="push_explain">Instant alerts use UnifiedPush. Install the ntfy app, point it at your own ntfy server (Settings → Default server), and pick it below. Each host gets its own subscription. A push only wakes Nightwatch up: it then fetches the real alert from the host over the tailnet.</string>
